{"kind":"api","name":"range.conditionalFormats","summary":"Conditional formatting rules scoped to a range.","tags":["conditional-formatting","conditional formatting","conditional format","range.conditionalFormats"],"examples":[{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('B2:B6');
range.conditionalFormats.add('colorScale', {
  colors: ['#FCA5A5', '#DC2626'],
});","summary":"Add a color scale rule"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('B2:B6');
range.conditionalFormats.add('colorScale', {
  criteria: [
    { type: 'lowestValue', color: '#DC2626' },
    { type: 'percentile', value: 50, color: '#FBBF24' },
    { type: 'highestValue', color: '#16A34A' },
  ],
});","summary":"Add a 3-stop color scale (min/mid/max)"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('B2:B6');
range.conditionalFormats.add('Custom', {
  formula: '=B2>10',
  format: { fill: '#FDE68A', font: { bold: true } },
});","summary":"Add a custom formula rule"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('B2:B6');
range.conditionalFormats.addCellIs({
  operator: 'lessThan',
  formula: 0,
  format: { fill: '#F8CBAD' },
});","summary":"Add a cell value rule"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('C2:C10');
range.conditionalFormats.add('dataBar', {
  color: 'accent5',
  gradient: true,
});","summary":"Add data bars (color bars) for magnitude"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('D2:D10');
range.conditionalFormats.add('iconSet', {
  iconSet: '3Arrows',
  showValue: false,
  reverse: false,
  percent: true,
});","summary":"Add an icon set for quick up/flat/down signals"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('E2:E8');
range.conditionalFormats.add('containsText', {
  text: 'late',
  format: { fill: '#FDE68A', font: { color: '#92400E', bold: true } },
});","summary":"Highlight text cells that contain a substring"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('F2:F12');
range.conditionalFormats.add('timePeriod', {
  timePeriod: 'last7Days',
  format: { fill: '#DBEAFE', font: { color: '#1D4ED8' } },
});","summary":"Highlight dates in a relative time window"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('G2:G20');
range.conditionalFormats.add('top10', {
  rank: 10,
  percent: true,
  format: { fill: '#DCFCE7', font: { color: '#166534' } },
});","summary":"Highlight top-ranked values by count or percent"},{"code":"const range = sheet.getRange('H2:H20');
range.conditionalFormats.add('aboveAverage', {
  aboveAverage: false,
  equalAverage: true,
  format: { fill: '#FECACA', font: { color: '#991B1B' } },
});","summary":"Highlight values below or equal to the average"}],"notes":["Compat alias: use type='CellValue' for cellIs rules.","Use Custom as an alias for expression rules.","Supported rule types include: cellIs, colorScale, dataBar, iconSet, expression (Custom), text rules, blank/error rules, duplicate/unique, timePeriod, top10, and aboveAverage.","colorScale accepts { colors, thresholds } or criteria objects/arrays.","Data bars accept showValue, minLength/maxLength (integer percentages), gradient, border, direction, axisPosition, and positive/negative fill, border, and axis colors.","Visualization thresholds accept formula strings via { type: 'formula', value }; data bars additionally accept { type: 'autoMin' } and { type: 'autoMax' } to include zero. Icon thresholds preserve gte:false for strict comparison.","iconSet preserves showValue/reverse/custom/percent/thresholds in inspect output.","Use range.conditionalFormats.add(type, config) to add rules.","Use range.conditionalFormats.clear() (or deleteAll()) to remove rules.","Use range.conditionalFormats.addCellIs({ operator, formula, format }) for cellIs rules.","Use range.conditionalFormats.addExpression(...) and addCustom(...) as expression-rule convenience aliases."]}
